@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    ``wait_exponential_jitter`` gains a ``min`` argument that sets a floor on the
+    wait, matching ``wait_exponential``. Its ``max``, ``jitter`` and ``min``
+    arguments accept ``datetime.timedelta`` values as well as numbers of seconds.
